  "name": "Chicken Fettuccine with Tequila-Lime Sauce",
  "subtitle": "Tender chicken and peppers in a creamy, bright skillet sauce",
  "description": "Fettuccine is tossed with sautéed chicken, colorful peppers, and a creamy tequila-lime sauce finished with cilantro.",
